---

---

<section id="kontakt" class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low overflow-hidden">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16">
      <!-- Left: contact info -->
      <div class="lg:w-1/3">
        <h2
          class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-8 text-on-surface"
        >
          Kontaktirajte nas
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-12">
          Pripravljeni smo odgovoriti na vsa vaša vprašanja in pripraviti
          neobvezujočo ponudbo.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
              aria-hidden="true">phone_in_talk</span
            >
            <div>
              <p
                class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary"
              >
                Telefon
              </p>
              <a
                href="tel:031556508"
                class="text-lg font-headline font-bold hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                >031-556-508</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
              aria-hidden="true">mail</span
            >
            <div>
              <p
                class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary"
              >
                E-pošta
              </p>
              <a
                href="mailto:info@alesjelnikar.si"
                class="text-lg font-headline font-bold hover:text-primary transition-colors"
                >info@alesjelnikar.si</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
              aria-hidden="true">location_on</span
            >
            <div>
              <p
                class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary"
              >
                Lokacija
              </p>
              <p class="text-lg font-headline font-bold">
                Ljubljana &amp; okolica, Slovenija
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Map placeholder -->
        <div
          class="mt-12 w-full h-48 bg-surface-container grayscale opacity-80 overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/30"
        >
          <img
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            alt="Zemljevid osrednje Slovenije"
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAf3hkBNuJsA_uQE40BNJbdRzQqxlzvuJjmA0oM-9WBTmmdgMztOJ9-wiatjzW-GerCwoTjOCytQm_YzEGBiwavv9zUUVsszgTtzWZ3peFDUQl-krrWPAMII1KFuo3-DkFaE4MRe4qfVmbLt7WgIn-bKW7fqfQQWZliOeVeifSHhj_-oYKetdYkwM8I3cLSPUnZxrhPUhIlKPtsgSId8Yw7c3y7jyxd21E1GdJyLAmyqQLwJAQT79jpqqK3hRAQU6hBdf75zqnGViWt"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: inquiry CTA -->
      <div class="lg:w-2/3 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-center">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-5xl mb-6" aria-hidden="true">edit_note</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-extrabold mb-3">Pošljite podrobno povpraševanje</h3>
        <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Izpolnite kratek obrazec z vsemi potrebnimi podatki. Aleš bo na podlagi vaših odgovorov pripravil natančen predračun — brez nepotrebnih klicev.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-10 text-sm text-secondary">
          <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-base shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
            Nova montaža strešnega okna VELUX
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-base shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
            Servis ali popravilo obstoječega okna
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-2 items-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-base shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
            Odgovor v najkrajšem možnem času
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/povprasevanje"
          class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-bold py-5 text-center hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all uppercase tracking-widest"
        >
          Pošlji povpraševanje
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
